## What was upgraded

| Area | Before (audited) | After (rebuild) |
|---|---|---|
| **Mobile experience** | Desktop-only navigation, no hamburger drawer visible from the audit pattern | Mobile-first responsive layout; hamburger drawer; cart-drawer; touch targets ≥44px (≥52px primary) |
| **Header** | Multi-row chrome with rotating top strip, multiple logos appearing twice | Single sticky header — logo + 7-link nav + search pill + sign-in + cart |
| **Login-gated pricing** | "Click Here For Pricing & Ordering" link that goes to wholesale-tunnel | WizCommerce-standard "Sign in for price" lock icon on every product card; PDP price box; Login → Add-to-Cart state machine |
| **PDP gallery** | Linear stack of variant photos, no main+thumb gallery | Sticky main image + 4-thumb strip + 47-color variant grid with named labels (scrolls within max-height) |
| **PLP discovery** | Long vertical list of variant photos, no filtering, no sort | Faceted filter sidebar (Subcategory / Color / Material / Pattern / In stock) + sticky sub-category pill bar + Sort dropdown + 4-col grid + pagination |
| **Hero** | 7 rotating banner images (auto-advancing carousel) | Manual hero (older-B2B safe — no autoplay). User clicks thumbs to cycle. Trust line below CTA. |
| **Trade affordances** | Show Schedule link in top strip, no calendar widget | Show Schedule grid (4 + 8 cards), trade-show CTA from home page |
| **Account** | Order History + Favorites links | Full account dashboard — sidebar with avatar, recent orders table, open-orders/cart/net-30 KPIs |
| **Footer** | 3-column footer (Customer Service / Information) | 5-column footer (Shop / Customer Service / Information / Wholesale + brand block with phone + payment pills) |
| **Type scale** | Web-default body (~14–15px) | 17px body floor (older-B2B), Cormorant Garamond display + Inter body |
| **Contrast** | Hero/category text low contrast in places | WCAG-AAA aim on body text; AA enforced on accent colors |
| **CTA hierarchy** | Buttons reading as text links | Branded primary buttons (52px tall) in Magic Burgundy `#8B2942` |
| **Faire integration** | Hero banner pointing to Faire only | Dedicated FAIRE band on home + `/faire` view with explicit copy |
| **Reduced motion** | Auto-advance carousel | `@media (prefers-reduced-motion)` honored everywhere |

